"Language: zh_Hans\n"

msgid "DashPlay"
msgstr "DashPlay"

msgid "CarPlay in the car's web browser. Set up Wi-Fi under Network → Wireless as usual; DashPlay hands one of these networks to the iPhone over Bluetooth, and the head unit opens the CarPlay page on the same network."
msgstr "在车机浏览器里用 CarPlay。WiFi 照常在「网络 → 无线」里设置；DashPlay 经蓝牙把其中一个 WiFi 交给 iPhone，车机连同一个 WiFi 打开 CarPlay 画面。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Not running"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "Open"
msgstr "打开"

msgid "DashPlay settings (add iPhone)"
msgstr "DashPlay 设置（添加 iPhone）"

msgid "CarPlay screen"
msgstr "CarPlay 画面"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Wi-Fi handed to the iPhone"
msgstr "交给 iPhone 的 WiFi"

msgid "The iPhone joins this network for wireless CarPlay. The router's own access point works best; a network the router joins as a client must be in a firewall zone that accepts input."
msgstr "无线 CarPlay 时 iPhone 连这个 WiFi。最好用路由器自己的热点；路由器作为客户端连接的网络，必须在允许入站的防火墙区域里。"

msgid "Automatic (first access point, 5 GHz first)"
msgstr "自动（第一个热点，优先 5 GHz）"

msgid "access point"
msgstr "热点"

msgid "client"
msgstr "客户端"

msgid "Settings page port"
msgstr "设置页端口"

msgid "Address name"
msgstr "访问名称"

msgid "On the router's access point the head unit opens %s"
msgstr "车机连上路由器热点后打开 %s"
